OL,3,GNEWSAOfficers cleared over 'fake
OL,4,Akeyboard activity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven former or serving police
OL,7,Fofficers have been cleared of gross
OL,8,Fmisconduct allegations that they used
OL,9,Fsoftware to "fake" keyboard activity.
OL,11,FA misconduct hearing on Wednesday found
OL,12,Fthree serving Devon & Cornwall Police
OL,13,Fofficers and eight former officers had
OL,14,Fno case to answer, the force said.
OL,16,FThe officers were accused of
OL,17,Fdownloading and utilising software
OL,18,Fcapable of simulating keyboard
OL,19,Factivity, creating the appearance they
OL,20,Fwere actively working at their
OL,21,Fcomputers when they were away from
OL,22,Ftheir desks.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
